ey":"简体中文名","value":"珀西瓦里·阿瑟库尼兹"},{"key":"别名","value":[{"k":"英文名","v":"Percival Asengunitz"},{"k":"日文名","v":"パーシヴァル・アセグニッツ"}]},{"key":"性别","value":"男"},{"key":"引用来源","value":"https://returners-magic.com/character/"}],"stat":{"comments":0,"collects":0},"id":146941,"locked":false,"type":1,"nsfw":false},{"birth_mon":null,"gender":"female","birth_day":null,"birth_year":null,"blood_type":null,"images":{"small":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/100/pic/crt/l/39/f0/137892_crt_mHNZN.jpg?r=1694324949","grid":"https://lain.bgm.tv/pic/crt/g/39/f0/137892_crt_mHNZN.jpg?r=1694324949","large":"https://lain.bgm.tv/pic/crt/l/39/f0/137892_crt_mHNZN.jpg?r=1694324949","medium":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/400/pic/crt/l/39/f0/137892_crt_mHNZN.jpg?r=1694324949"},"summary":"冰属性的贵族魔剑士。进入赫布里温学院时，已经是高等级的魔法使，而且剑术超过了骑士。\r\n归还之前，她在“影之迷宫”中与戴基尔战斗到最后，成为世界毁灭的导火线。\r\n面无表情，不爱说话，难以读懂她的感情。","name":"아제스트 킹스크라운","infobox":[{"key":"简体中文名","value":"阿洁丝特·皇克拉恩"},{"key":"别名","value":[{"k":"第二中文名","v":"阿泽斯特·金斯克劳恩"},{"k":"英文名","v":"Azest Kingscrown"},{"k":"日文名","v":"アゼスト・キングスクラウン"},{"k":"罗马字","v":"Azesuto Kingusukuraun"}]},{"key":"性别","value":"女"},{"key":"引用来源","value":"https://returners-magic.com/character/"}],"stat":{"comments":4,"collects":21},"id":137892,"locked":false,"type":1,"nsfw":false},{"birth_mon":null,"gender":"male","birth_day":null,"birth_year":null,"blood_type":null,"images":{"small":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/100/pic/crt/l/97/02/146940_crt_V8rUa.jpg","grid":"https://lain.bgm.tv/pic/crt/g/97/02/146940_crt_V8rUa.jpg","large":"https://lain.bgm.tv/pic/crt/l/97/02/146940_crt_V8rUa.jpg","medium":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/400/pic/crt/l/97/02/146940_crt_V8rUa.jpg"},"summary":"“蓝月”队伍所属的A班学生。\r\n作为贵族，他有着极高的自豪感，动不动就看不起B班，说“平民是肮脏的”。因此，他将拒绝他的告白和加入“蓝月”邀请的罗曼蒂卡视为眼中钉。\r\n他讨厌平民的原因似乎与他的过去有关。","name":"도네타 하둔","infobox":[{"key":"简体中文名","value":"多内塔·哈顿"},{"key":"别名","value":[{"k":"英文名","v":"Doneta Hadoon"},{"k":"日文名","v":"ドネータ・ハーデン"}]},{"key":"性别","value":"男"},{"key":"引用来源","value":"https://returners-magic.com/character/"}],"stat":{"comment